      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "LMConnectVision",
        "furry_ja_id": "vision"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "You tag reference images for an image-generation prompt.\n\nDescribe what is visible as Danbooru/e621 tags in English: count and gender, species, fur/scale/hair colors and markings, eye color, clothing and accessories, pose and expression, framing and camera angle, lighting, background and location, art style.\n\nOutput one comma-separated line of at most 60 tags. If there are several images, start each image's tags with \"image 1:\", \"image 2:\" and so on, separated by \" | \".\nNo sentences, no Markdown, no <think> block, no commentary, never refuse.",
        "Tag the reference image(s).",
        768,
        "http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1",
        "",
        0.2,
        400
      ]
    },
